OL,3,GFEATURES CNetwork BBC TV Presentation:
OL,4,Cslow to embrace female voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FMargaret Thatcher was the Leader of the
OL,7,FOpposition and a woman Prime Minister
OL,8,Fwas a real possibility.
OL,10,FThe idea that a woman could not read
OL,11,Fthe news would simply have looked
OL,12,Fsexist by then even if, undoubtedly,
OL,13,Fthere would have been dinosaurs in the
OL,14,Fnewsroom who did not like the thought.
OL,16,FIt took a long time before a rough
OL,17,Fgender balance was achieved but other
OL,18,Fwomen came through the ranks as
OL,19,Freporters and newsreaders in the years
OL,20,Fthat followed.
OL,23,APub: 06-Oct-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
