OL,3,GFEATURES CNetwork BBC TV Presentation:
OL,4,Cslow to embrace female voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FReportedly complaints were received
OL,7,Fwhen women were heard on the evening
OL,8,Fshifts:
OL,10,FIt is astounding to think of viewers
OL,11,Fobjecting to a woman announcer yet, by
OL,12,Fimplication, accepting a woman
OL,13,Fnewsreader.
OL,15,FIt would be sad to think of
OL,16,FPresentation listening to such
OL,17,Fcomplaints when, it would seem the news
OL,18,Fand current affairs departments would
OL,19,Fhave dismissed any suggestions that
OL,20,Fwomen were unsuitable for high-profile
OL,21,Froles.
OL,23,APub: 06-Oct-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
