OL,3,GFEATURES CNetwork BBC TV Presentation:
OL,4,Cslow to embrace female voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FLet's face it ` reading the Nine
OL,7,Fo'Clock News or presenting Nationwide
OL,8,Fwas far more important than continuity
OL,9,Fannouncing.
OL,11,FIt's also strange that network
OL,12,Fpresentation appeared to receive
OL,13,Fcomplaints about female voices which
OL,14,Fweren't simply filed in the bin given
OL,15,Fthe circumstances of the time.
OL,23,APub: 06-Oct-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
