OL,3,GFEATURES CNetwork BBC TV Presentation:
OL,4,Cslow to embrace female voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FBetween 1976 and 1980, the evening
OL,7,Fnetwork announcer on BBC One was only
OL,8,Fheard in London and the South East on
OL,9,Fweeknights. Many regions though
OL,10,Femployed women with no apparent
OL,11,Fknockback.
OL,13,FYou would also like to imagine that
OL,14,Fwhenever a woman was heard on BBC Two,
OL,15,Fits viewers would have been less
OL,16,Fresistant to change.
OL,23,APub: 06-Oct-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
