CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F133A1768767025
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                G11/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CNetwork BBC TV Presentation:
OL,4,Cslow to embrace female voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo it is worth reflecting on the fact
OL,7,Fthat there were few women announcers on
OL,8,Fthe BBC networks for many years even
OL,9,Fwhile women like Angela Rippon were
OL,10,Fsmashing glass ceilings in much more
OL,11,Fprominent and important roles.
OL,23,APub: 06-Oct-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
